sequenceDiagram
  participant BR as Browser
  participant API as FastAPI backend
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AU as Audit log
  BR->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  API->>DB: load user, check locked_until
  alt wrong password
    API->>DB: failed_logins + 1, lock 5 min at 5
    API->>AU: auth.login_failed with client IP
    API-->>BR: 401 invalid_credentials
  else correct password
    API->>DB: reset counters, set last_login_at
    API->>AU: auth.login
    API-->>BR: 200, HttpOnly JWT cookie, CSRF cookie
  end
  BR->>API: POST with cookie and X-CSRF-Token
  API->>DB: verify JWT and CSRF, load role
  alt permission missing
    API->>AU: access.denied
    API-->>BR: 403 permission_denied
  else allowed
    API-->>BR: 2xx response
  end
